cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use deepToolsR, please cite this software and the deepTools paper it
  is based on (listed under references).
title: deepToolsR
abstract: >-
  C++-accelerated tools for analysing and plotting deep sequencing data; an
  independent reimplementation based on deepTools 3.5.6, not affiliated with
  the deepTools project.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Krystian
    family-names: Łazowski
    email: k.lazowski@exeter.ac.uk
version: 0.9.1
date-released: 2026-10-02
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/krystianll/deepToolsR
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - deep sequencing
  - ChIP-seq
  - RNA-seq
  - deepTools
references:
